{
  "message": "I read “Sprint 2”: the reported second island and reef damage advance the slice, but no build verifies them. Without a build or five-player findings, the goal remains at risk with 20–30 confirmed hours left. Use this last route change to drop the trailer and defer co-op: share one rough solo island with route-changing tides by sprint 3. At the next review, I look forward to your downloadable prototype and fresh devlog posts ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard and defer co-op sailing. Narrow the goal to a smaller, tested tide prototype.",
      "itemId": "cmvtkk8c408yfnxz8i1hs2qkb",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "By the end of sprint 3, share a downloadable solo prototype with one rough island and a tide cycle that changes a sailing route.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Reserve sprint 4 for five-player tests: record whether players understand the tide’s effect, then share the findings and final downloadable build.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

